    "title": "Resident Center",
    "description": "Resident Center, powered by Buildium, is designed with simplicity in mind. You can make payments, submit maintenance requests, contact your property manager, learn about your community, and more\u2013with just a few taps. Features may vary depending on your property management company.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n-  Never miss payment deadline again! With autopay you can set up recurring payments through your bank account or credit card.\r\n-  Don't stress if you have an issue that needs to be fixed! Easily submit a request right from the app and include a photo so your property manager can get it resolved as soon as possible.\r\n-  Stay informed about your building and unit. Your property manager can post announcements through the app to give you a heads up about things like parking bans, office hours, or even fun events in your neighborhood.",
